channel.description:
Synopsis Make golang tests easy, from simplest usage:
import ( "testing" "github.com/maxatome/go-testdeep/td" ) func TestMyFunc(t *testing.T) { td.Cmp(t, MyFunc(), &Info{Name: "Alice", Age: 42}) } To a bit more complex one, allowing flexible comparisons using TestDeep operators:
import ( "testing" "github.com/maxatome/go-testdeep/td" ) func TestMyFunc(t *testing.T) { td.Cmp(t, MyFunc(), td.Struct( &Info{Name: "Alice"}, td.StructFields{ "Age": td.Between(40, 45), }, )) } Or anchoring operators directly in literals, as in:
